  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of material assistance (NFIs and Hygiene Kits) and health support to the IDP in Vinnitsya and Poltava Oblasts, through integrated protection approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main goal: Provision of material assistance (NFIs and Hygiene Kits) and health support to the IDP in Vinnitsya and Poltava Oblasts (and other areas based on identified emergency needs), through integrated protection approach

Objectives: Approx 4000 HH within 40 transit/collective shelters as part of the conflict-affected displaced populations and the vulnerable host community in Vinnitsya and Poltava Oblasts, have access to integrated essential material assistance and health services</narrative>
  </description>
