    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">40 shelters (10 in Vinnytsia municipality+10 in Vinnytsia oblast, 10 in Poltava municipality + 10 in Poltava oblast) and 2 health point in Poltava railway station receive the donation of first aid material+ over the counter meds</narrative>
